Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.00,0:02:35.00,HEADA,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs54\c&H8CDC4A&\an8\pos(540,24)}▍{\r\fn得意黑\fs54}2026 WTA500 新加坡站 1/4决赛
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:02:35.00,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs38\c&H8CDC4A&\an8\pos(540,92)}赫瓦林斯卡 {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}6-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}2 {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}6-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}2{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs38} 梅尔滕斯 · 赛后场上采访
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.32,0:00:02.08,EN,,0,0,0,,A big congratulations to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.32,0:00:02.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,恭喜你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.08,0:00:02.88,EN,,0,0,0,,You've just taken out
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.08,0:00:02.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,你刚刚淘汰了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.88,0:00:05.76,EN,,0,0,0,,the defending champion here in Singapore.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.88,0:00:05.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,新加坡站的卫冕冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.76,0:00:09.20,EN,,0,0,0,,Let's talk about your performance today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.76,0:00:09.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,聊聊你今天的表现
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.20,0:00:10.80,EN,,0,0,0,,6-2, 6-2.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.20,0:00:10.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,6比2 6比2
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.80,0:00:13.20,EN,,0,0,0,,What were you most happy with?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.80,0:00:13.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,你最满意的是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.20,0:00:14.48,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.20,0:00:14.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.48,0:00:17.28,EN,,0,0,0,,Elise is such a solid player.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.48,0:00:17.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,梅尔滕斯是个非常扎实的球员
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.28,0:00:19.52,EN,,0,0,0,,She's definitely a great player.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.28,0:00:19.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,她绝对是个很出色的球员
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.52,0:00:20.32,EN,,0,0,0,,Tough to beat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.52,0:00:20.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,很难击败
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.32,0:00:23.28,EN,,0,0,0,,So I knew that I need to play my best tennis
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.32,0:00:23.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我知道得打出最好的网球
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.28,0:00:24.88,EN,,0,0,0,,to win today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.28,0:00:24.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,才能赢下今天
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.88,0:00:27.44,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I just really wanted to fight
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.88,0:00:27.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,是的 我就是想拼
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.44,0:00:29.28,EN,,0,0,0,,for every single ball, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.44,0:00:29.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,你知道 每一分都要去拼
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.28,0:00:30.80,EN,,0,0,0,,focus on my goals for the match
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.28,0:00:30.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,专注在这场球的目标上
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.80,0:00:32.80,EN,,0,0,0,,and give myself the best chance to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.80,0:00:32.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,给自己最大的赢球机会
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.80,0:00:37.56,EN,,0,0,0,,And yeah, I'm happy that I did that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.80,0:00:37.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,我很高兴我做到了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.12,0:00:40.32,EN,,0,0,0,,Now, I'd like to ask you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.12,0:00:40.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,我想问问你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.32,0:00:42.16,EN,,0,0,0,,about how you feel overall
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.32,0:00:42.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,整体感觉怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.16,0:00:43.84,EN,,0,0,0,,because you've played three matches here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.16,0:00:43.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,你在这里打了三场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.84,0:00:46.32,EN,,0,0,0,,You've only lost 11 games in total.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.84,0:00:46.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,一共只丢了11局
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.32,0:00:48.16,EN,,0,0,0,,What do you feel is clicking
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.32,0:00:48.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,你觉得是什么开窍了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.16,0:00:50.56,EN,,0,0,0,,while you're in Singapore?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.16,0:00:50.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,让你在新加坡这么顺？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.56,0:00:50.88,EN,,0,0,0,,Um,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.56,0:00:50.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.88,0:00:52.48,EN,,0,0,0,,what's working for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.88,0:00:52.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,是什么在起作用？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.48,0:00:54.56,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, I need to only play in Singapore,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.48,0:00:54.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,那看来我只能在新加坡打球了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.56,0:00:55.44,EN,,0,0,0,,I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.56,0:00:55.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,我猜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.44,0:00:58.44,EN,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.44,0:00:58.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.16,0:01:04.48,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, you know, like season
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.16,0:01:04.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,我是说 你知道 一个赛季
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.48,0:01:06.56,EN,,0,0,0,,has so many weeks and it's impossible
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.48,0:01:06.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,有那么多周 根本不可能
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.56,0:01:09.36,EN,,0,0,0,,to just play great every single week.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.56,0:01:09.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,每一周都打得很好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.36,0:01:12.40,EN,,0,0,0,,So, it's just about consistency and work
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.36,0:01:12.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以关键就是稳定和努力
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.40,0:01:15.52,EN,,0,0,0,,and you got to be patient also.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.40,0:01:15.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有你也得有耐心
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.52,0:01:16.24,EN,,0,0,0,,You're going
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.52,0:01:16.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,你会
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.24,0:01:18.64,EN,,0,0,0,,to have like tougher weeks ahead of you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.24,0:01:18.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,遇到更难熬的几周
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.64,0:01:19.20,EN,,0,0,0,,for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.64,0:01:19.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,这是肯定的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.20,0:01:21.28,EN,,0,0,0,,But yeah, I'm just happy that, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.20,0:01:21.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,但我很高兴 你知道
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.28,0:01:24.00,EN,,0,0,0,,I stayed quite patient.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.28,0:01:24.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,我一直很有耐心
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.00,0:01:26.16,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I worked hard and happy
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.00,0:01:26.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,我努力了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.16,0:01:28.16,EN,,0,0,0,,that it's paying off now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.16,0:01:28.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,很高兴现在有了回报
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.16,0:01:29.28,EN,,0,0,0,,We would love for you to play
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.16,0:01:29.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们很希望你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.28,0:01:32.08,EN,,0,0,0,,in Singapore all the time,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.28,0:01:32.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,一直在新加坡打球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.08,0:01:34.96,EN,,0,0,0,,but you are through to the semifinals.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.08,0:01:34.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,不过你已经打进半决赛了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.96,0:01:36.00,EN,,0,0,0,,Good, Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.96,0:01:36.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.00,0:01:39.04,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.00,0:01:39.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.04,0:01:40.72,EN,,0,0,0,,You are through to the semi-finals here
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.04,0:01:40.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,你打进了半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.72,0:01:41.36,EN,,0,0,0,,in Singapore.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.72,0:01:41.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,在新加坡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.36,0:01:44.88,EN,,0,0,0,,It's your second tour-level semifinal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.36,0:01:44.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,你第二次打进巡回赛半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.88,0:01:47.36,EN,,0,0,0,,How important is this for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.88,0:01:47.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,这对你有多重要？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.36,0:01:49.04,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it is for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.36,0:01:49.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,是的 当然重要
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.04,0:01:51.28,EN,,0,0,0,,I had some tough weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.04,0:01:51.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,我经历过一些难熬的几周
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.28,0:01:54.40,EN,,0,0,0,,So this one tastes pretty good,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.28,0:01:54.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以这一场的滋味相当好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.40,0:01:55.84,EN,,0,0,0,,I must admit.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.40,0:01:55.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,我得承认
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.84,0:01:58.40,EN,,0,0,0,,All right. And lastly, lastly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.84,0:01:58.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,好 最后 最后一个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.40,0:02:00.80,EN,,0,0,0,,a very loud crowd once again here
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.40,0:02:00.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,今天的观众又特别热情
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.80,0:02:02.08,EN,,0,0,0,,on this Friday afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.80,0:02:02.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,在这个周五的下午
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.08,0:02:03.28,EN,,0,0,0,,A lot of Polish supporters.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.08,0:02:03.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,很多波兰球迷
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.28,0:02:04.56,EN,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you might want to say something
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.28,0:02:04.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,也许你想对他们
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.56,0:02:05.76,EN,,0,0,0,,to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.56,0:02:05.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,说几句
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.76,0:02:09.56,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.76,0:02:09.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,好的 当然
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.32,0:02:12.16,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Thank you guys all for coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.32,0:02:12.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢大家来看球
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.16,0:02:14.00,EN,,0,0,0,,I hope to see you tomorrow as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.16,0:02:14.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,希望明天也能见到你们
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.00,0:02:16.96,EN,,0,0,0,,Drink for me, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.00,0:02:16.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,当然 替我喝一杯
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.96,0:02:20.16,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, so happy to see Polish flags
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.96,0:02:20.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,又看到波兰国旗 真开心
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.16,0:02:21.76,EN,,0,0,0,,as well again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.16,0:02:21.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,又一次
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.76,0:02:23.52,EN,,0,0,0,,You guys don't disappoint.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.76,0:02:23.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,你们从不让人失望
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.52,0:02:25.68,EN,,0,0,0,,So yeah, very happy and grateful
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.52,0:02:25.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,我非常开心 也很感激
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.68,0:02:29.76,EN,,0,0,0,,for you guys and see you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.68,0:02:29.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,感谢你们 明天见
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.76,0:02:30.80,EN,,0,0,0,,Ladies and gentlemen,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.76,0:02:30.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,女士们先生们
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.80,0:02:33.66,EN,,0,0,0,,let's hear it for Maja Chwalinska.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.80,0:02:33.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,让我们为赫瓦林斯卡鼓掌
